This repository is a derivative work. Read this section before redistributing.

本仓库是衍生作品，再分发前请先阅读本节。

---

Provenance / 来源

Open Reasoning — s-JoL, https://github.com/s-JoL/open-reasoning

That project published the demo and a set of unlocked examples, but not the
recovery implementation. It was reachable when this work began and now returns
HTTP 404. `static/index.html` here is a vendored copy of its demo frontend,
included for reproducibility; copyright remains with its original author.

该项目发布了演示与一组解锁样例，但未公开还原实现。本工作开始时该仓库可访问，现返回
HTTP 404。本仓库的 `static/index.html` 是其演示前端的 vendored 副本，仅为复现目的收录，
版权归原作者所有。

