Licensing status / 授权状态

The upstream project carries no explicit licence grant. Absent a licence, default
copyright applies and the copyright holder retains all rights. Forking a public
GitHub repository is permitted by the GitHub Terms of Service, but that permission
does not extend to relicensing inherited files or redistributing them outside
GitHub. The MIT grant below therefore covers **only the original contributions of
this repository**; it does not and cannot relicense the vendored frontend.

上游项目没有明确的授权声明。在缺少许可证的情况下适用默认著作权，权利由著作权人保留。
GitHub 服务条款允许 fork 公开仓库，但该许可不延伸至对继承文件的重新授权，也不覆盖在
GitHub 之外的再分发。因此下方的 MIT 授权**仅适用于本仓库的原创贡献**，不对 vendored
前端重新授权，也无权这样做。

If you are the author of the upstream project and want attribution changed, a
licence applied, or material removed, please open an issue.

如果您是上游项目作者，希望调整署名、补充授权或移除相关内容，请提交 issue。

